        "edit": "Swap the mux branch assignments so that s!=0 selects b and s==0 selects a, correcting the inverted select polarity that caused the cycle2-5 output mismatches.",
        "lens_id": "generic_v1",
        "replacement_rtl": "module mux21(a,b,s,y);\n\tinput a,b,s;\n\toutput y;\n\treg y;\n\talways @(a,b,s)\n\tif(s!=0) y=b;\n\telse y=a;\nendmodule",
